# AI Video Studio - example configuration. No real secrets belong in this file.
#
# Frontend (apps/studio): only non-secret values. Anything prefixed VITE_ is public.
# In local development the Vite dev server proxies /api to the Worker, so this can stay empty.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# Worker (workers/api): non-secret vars live in wrangler.jsonc.
# Local-only secrets go in workers/api/.dev.vars (git-ignored); production secrets are set with
#   pnpm --filter @avs/api exec wrangler secret put <NAME>
# No provider keys are needed yet. Paid providers stay disabled unless explicitly enabled.
